 **anonymous2026expert_persona**: Update authors from \"Anonymous\" to \"Hu, Rostami, Thomason\" and rename id.\n115\t\n116\t### Optional\n117\t4. **basil2025playing_pretend**: Consider adding full title prefix \"Prompting Science Report 4:\" for completeness.\n118\t\n119\t### No Hallucinated Papers Found\n120\tAll 8 arXiv IDs resolve to real papers with matching titles. No fabricated references detected.\n121\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0139bvowbJY2nBJ3A9LAYjKZ","session_id":"c3934af1-82f0-438e-bd39-6838b74091c7","uuid":"405db513-76e2-46c3-89da-d796e961ab8c","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:16:43.696Z"}
